## Three ideas that must not be conflated

The literal recurrence, the displayed finite pattern, and the proposed quarter-quadratic model are different mathematical objects. Compare their scales directly.

{{visualization:2}}

A repaired problem must say whether new terms are unused or increasing and whether they avoid one recent sum or the entire historical sumset. For background, see [greedy algorithms](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greedy_algorithm), [additive combinatorics](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Additive_combinatorics), and [complete graphs](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Complete_graph).

